defects.change:
engine/editeur/broll.py:
- Slots are never placed in the hook (first sentence, from sobriete.reperes) or in the last CTA sentence.
- A new _content_word filter rejects STOP/WEAK words, number words, adverbs ending in -ment, words under 4 letters, known brands and proper nouns (sobriete.nom_propre: camel case, or a capital letter mid-sentence such as 'RyuCalls' or 'Rio Cause').
- For a cut-masking slot, the word is now the strongest content word near the cut, or nothing.
- In auto mode, a b-roll is inserted only if all of these hold:
  - it is a concept slot (a cut is never masked automatically);
  - the LLM said 'illustrable' (banques.queries_for is now called in auto mode even without banks);
  - a new batched LLM check at temperature 0 (_concrete, answers keyed by index because Qwen skipped items in list answers) says the word is a concrete, filmable thing;
  - confidence is 'haute': local CLIP score >= 0.31 and at least 0.015 ahead of the next library video; for banks, rank 'haute' with auto;
  - no person on screen (CLIP person-vs-thing test on the chosen second for local clips, tags for bank clips), unless the spoken words around the word are about people (PEOPLE_FR);
  - at most 1 per 12 s (AUTO_ECART).
- Inserted b-rolls carry auto:true, reason and confidence.
- Everything not inserted is stored in reel.suggestions.broll, with the reason ('pourquoi') and the top 3 candidates.
- In auto mode, concept slots now come before cut slots.

